OL,3,GNEWSAHalf a tonne of waste cleared from
OL,4,AA1 verges
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half a tonne of waste was
OL,7,Fremoved from the side of the A1 in
OL,8,FLincolnshire, a council said.
OL,10,FSouth Kesteven District Council spent
OL,11,Ftwo nights clearing rubbish from the
OL,12,Fverges of the road near Grantham.
OL,14,FThe haul included 617lbs (280kg) of
OL,15,Fwaste, 926lbs (420kg) of scrap metal
OL,16,Fand eight lorry tyres.
OL,18,FA carriageway closure due to roadworks
OL,19,Fallowed council staff to safely work to
OL,20,Fremove the litter along a stretch of
OL,21,Fthe route between Colsterworth and the
OL,22,FA607.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
